msgid "1.2 Your goal {#12-your-goal}"
msgstr "1.2 Tu objetivo {#12-your-goal}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build a GHZ circuit for 20 qubits or more so that, upon measurement, **the fidelity of your GHZ state > 0.5.**\n"
"Note:\n"
"- You need to use an Eagle device (`min_num_qubits=127`) and set the shots number as 40,000.\n"
"- You should execute the GHZ circuit using the `execute_ghz_fidelity` function, and calculate the fidelity using the `check_ghz_fidelity_from_jobs` function.\n"
msgstr ""
"Construye un circuito GHZ para 20 qubits o más de forma que, al medir, **la fidelidad de tu estado GHZ sea > 0.5.**\n"
"Nota:\n"
"- Debes usar un dispositivo Eagle (`min_num_qubits=127`) y establecer el número de shots en 40 000.\n"
"- Debes ejecutar el circuito GHZ con la función `execute_ghz_fidelity` y calcular la fidelidad con la función `check_ghz_fidelity_from_jobs`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is intended as an independent exercise, in which you leverage what you "
"have learned so far in this course.\n"
msgstr ""
"Este ejercicio está pensado para que lo realices de forma independiente, "
"aprovechando todo lo que has aprendido hasta ahora en este curso.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this notebook, we will apply three strategies to creating good GHZ states"
" using 16 qubits and 30 qubits. These approaches build on strategies you "
"already know from previous lessons.\n"
msgstr ""
"En este notebook aplicaremos tres estrategias para crear buenos estados GHZ "
"usando 16 qubits y 30 qubits. Estos enfoques parten de las estrategias que "
"ya conoces de lecciones anteriores.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. Strategy 1. Noise-aware qubit selection {#2-strategy-1-noise-aware-qubit-"
"selection}"
msgstr ""
"2. Estrategia 1. Selección de qubits con conciencia del ruido "
"{#2-strategy-1-noise-aware-qubit-selection}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We first specify a backend. Because we will be working extensively with the "
"properties of a specific backend, it is a good idea to specify one backend, "
"as opposed to using the ```least_busy``` option.\n"
msgstr ""
"Primero especificamos un backend. Como trabajaremos extensamente con las "
"propiedades de un backend específico, es buena idea especificar uno en "
"concreto, en lugar de usar la opción ```least_busy```.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We are going to build a circuit involving many two-qubit gates. It makes "
"sense for us to use the qubits that have the lowest errors when implementing"
" those two-qubit gates. Finding the best \"qubit chain\" based on the "
"reported 2q-gate errors is a nontrivial problem. But we can define a few "
"functions to help us determine the best qubits to use.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vamos a construir un circuito con muchas compuertas de dos qubits. Tiene "
"sentido usar los qubits que presenten los menores errores al implementar "
"esas compuertas de dos qubits. Encontrar la mejor \"cadena de qubits\" "
"basándose en los errores de compuertas de 2 qubits reportados es un problema"
" no trivial. Sin embargo, podemos definir algunas funciones para ayudarnos a"
" determinar los mejores qubits a utilizar.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will use the functions above to find all the simple paths of N qubits "
"between all pairs of nodes in the graph (Reference: "
"[all_pairs_all_simple_paths](https://www.rustworkx.org/apiref/rustworkx.all_pairs_all_simple_paths.html#rustworkx-"
"all-pairs-all-simple-paths)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Usaremos las funciones anteriores para encontrar todos los caminos simples "
"de N qubits entre todos los pares de nodos del grafo (Referencia: "
"[all_pairs_all_simple_paths](https://www.rustworkx.org/apiref/rustworkx.all_pairs_all_simple_paths.html#rustworkx-"
"all-pairs-all-simple-paths)).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then, using the `path_fidelity` function created above, we will find the "
"best qubit chain which has the largest path fidelity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Luego, usando la función `path_fidelity` creada anteriormente, encontraremos"
" la mejor cadena de qubits, que es la que tiene la mayor fidelidad de "
"camino.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's plot the best qubit chain, shown in pink, in the coupling map "
"diagram.\n"
msgstr ""
"Grafiquemos la mejor cadena de qubits, mostrada en rosa, en el diagrama del "
"mapa de acoplamiento.\n"

